#: src/telephony/ui/windows/trusted_actions_list_window.py:483
msgid ""
"Share this code with your trusted contact. They should add it to an "
"authenticator app such as Gnome Authenticator.\n"
"\n"
"If entering manually, ensure the following settings:\n"
"• Algorithm: SHA1\n"
"• Digits: 6\n"
"• Interval: 60 seconds\n"
"\n"
"Each action has its own code. When triggering an action by SMS, they must "
"append the current 6-digit code from their authenticator after the keyword."
msgstr ""
"Aka código confiable contacto ukamp uñt'ayaña. Jupanakax mä authenticator "
"app ukar yapxatañapawa, Gnome Authenticator ukarjama.\n"
"\n"
"Amparamp mantasa, aka wakichäwinak uñakipaña:\n"
"• Algoritmo: SHA1\n"
"• Digitos: 6\n"
"• Pacha: 60 segundos\n"
"\n"
"Sapa lurawix pachpa código ukaniwa. SMS tuqi mä lurawi sartayasaxa, jupanakax "
"jichha 6-digito código authenticator ukat keyword qhipäxan yapxatañapawa."

